    A small real Hermitian positive-definite matrix:

    >>> x = jnp.array([[2., 1.],
    ...                [1., 2.]])

    Upper Cholesky factorization:

    >>> jax.scipy.linalg.cholesky(x)
    Array([[1.4142135 , 0.70710677],
